\b\fs32 4. Pre-flight checks (Ellesmere IT)\b0\fs22\par
Complete these before changing DNS.\par
Confirm who can edit DNS for ellesmere.com in GoDaddy (or wherever DNS is managed if it later moves).\par
Search existing records for anything named international (A, AAAA, CNAME, TXT). As of the pre-launch check, international.ellesmere.com did not resolve \u8212? treat this as \u8220?create new,\u8221? but re-check before you publish.\par
Do not change existing records for: apex ellesmere.com; www; MX / mail (ellesmere-com.mail.protection.outlook.com today); existing TXT / verification records.\par
Confirm with the ECI team that hosting already has international.ellesmere.com added as a custom domain (so SSL can be issued as soon as DNS appears).\par
Agree a rollback: if something breaks, delete or disable the new international CNAME only \u8212? never touch www.\par
\b\fs32 5. Step-by-step: create the DNS record (GoDaddy)\b0\fs22\par
These steps assume DNS remains on GoDaddy Domain Control. If DNS is elsewhere, create the same record type in that provider.\par
\b\fs26 5.1 Open DNS management\b0\fs22\par
Sign in to GoDaddy.\par
Open Domain Portfolio \u8594? select ellesmere.com.\par
Open DNS / Manage DNS.\par
\b\fs26 5.2 Add the subdomain record\b0\fs22\par
Create one new record:\par
\par
Notes:\par
Enter only international in the Name field (GoDaddy appends .ellesmere.com).\par
Do not create an A record for international unless the hosting provider explicitly requires A/AAAA (rare for modern app hosts; Vercel/Netlify/Cloudflare Pages normally want CNAME).\par
Do not point this CNAME at ellesmerecom.finalsite.com or any *.finalsite.com / Finalsite CDN hostname.\par
\b\fs26 5.3 Save and wait for propagation\b0\fs22\par
Save the record.\par
Expect propagation in roughly minutes to a few hours (rarely up to 24\u8211?48 hours depending on prior TTL and resolvers).\par
Verify from your network with: dig +short international.ellesmere.com CNAME   and   dig +short international.ellesmere.com A\par
You should see the ECI host\u8217?s CNAME chain and then the host\u8217?s IPs \u8212? not Finalsite\u8217?s ellesmerecom.finalsite.com.\par
Browser check:\par
https://international.ellesmere.com should load the ECI site (or the host\u8217?s temporary \u8220?domain configured / certificate provisioning\u8221? page while SSL finishes).\par
https://www.ellesmere.com must still be the unchanged Finalsite site.\par
\b\fs32 6. SSL / HTTPS\b0\fs22\par
Ellesmere IT does not need to install a certificate in Finalsite or on school servers for this hostname.\par
The ECI hosting provider issues and renews TLS for international.ellesmere.com (Let\u8217?s Encrypt / platform-managed cert).\par
After DNS is correct, wait for the host\u8217?s domain status to show Valid / HTTPS ready.\par
If the browser shows a certificate name mismatch, DNS is still pointing at the wrong place or the host has not finished attaching the domain \u8212? fix DNS/host attachment; do not buy a separate cert for Finalsite.\par
Optional: force HTTPS redirects are handled by the ECI host, not Finalsite.\par
\b\fs32 7. Application-side tasks (ECI team \u8212? not Finalsite)\b0\fs22\par
Ellesmere IT can treat this section as a checklist the ECI team must complete in parallel.\par
Add custom domain international.ellesmere.com in the hosting console.\par
Set production environment variables (Supabase URL/anon key, optional LLM keys).\par
In Supabase Auth \u8594? URL configuration, allow Site URL https://international.ellesmere.com and Redirect URLs including https://international.ellesmere.com/** and https://international.ellesmere.com/auth/callback.\par
Confirm portals (/login, /investor, /agent, /school, /team) work on the new host.\par
Smoke-test public routes: /, /schools, /investors, /agents.\par
\b\fs32 8. Optional Finalsite work (links only)\b0\fs22\par
If Marketing/International want visitors on the main school site to find ECI:\par
In Finalsite Composer, edit the relevant nav item or International page.\par
Add a normal external link to https://international.ellesmere.com (open in same tab or new tab per school preference).\par
Do not create a Finalsite Domain / Host Name for international.ellesmere.com.\par
Do not ask Finalsite Support to \u8220?point the subdomain at a Composer page.\u8221?\par
Suggested link label examples: \u8220?Ellesmere College International\u8221?, \u8220?International\u8221?, or \u8220?Our international schools\u8221?.\par
\b\fs32 9. Email and other services\b0\fs22\par
\par
Creating the website CNAME does not affect mail unless someone mistakenly edits MX or root records \u8212? avoid that.\par
\b\fs32 10. Go-live checklist\b0\fs22\par
\b\fs26 Ellesmere IT\b0\fs22\par
Received CNAME target in writing from ECI team\par
Confirmed no conflicting international DNS record\par
Created CNAME international \u8594? ECI host target\par
Verified with dig that the name does not resolve to Finalsite\par
Confirmed https://www.ellesmere.com still loads Finalsite\par
(Optional) Added Finalsite nav/page link to the new URL\par
\b\fs26 ECI team\b0\fs22\par
Custom domain attached on host; SSL valid\par
Supabase auth URLs updated\par
Production env vars set; site builds and serves\par
Public + portal smoke tests passed\par
Stakeholders notified of the live URL\par
\b\fs32 11. Rollback\b0\fs22\par
In GoDaddy DNS, delete (or disable) only the international CNAME.\par
Leave all Finalsite / www / mail records untouched.\par
Tell the ECI team so they can remove or pause the custom domain on the host.\par
No Finalsite \u8220?Domain is live\u8221? change is involved, because this hostname was never added to Composer.\par
\b\fs32 12. Suggested message you can send Finalsite (only if needed)\b0\fs22\par
Use only if a Finalsite engineer asks why international is not pointed at Finalsite:\par
\i We are launching a separately hosted Ellesmere College International application at international.ellesmere.com. This hostname must remain a DNS CNAME to our external application host and must not be configured as a Finalsite Composer domain or Finalsite subdomain landing page. The primary site www.ellesmere.com stays on Finalsite unchanged. We may add a standard hyperlink from Composer to https://international.ellesmere.com.\i0 \par
