\b\fs32 Appendix B \u8212? Why this is separate from Finalsite\b0\fs22\par
The ECI platform is a modern application (public marketing pages plus password-controlled investor, agent, school, and team portals). It depends on its own hosting runtime and Supabase backend. Finalsite remains the system of record for the UK main school website; ECI is an adjacent brand property on a school-owned subdomain.\par
